    "body": "Escalated from effort:medium to effort:high under the work-issue safety-floor rule.\nThe fix changes the toolpath generator refusal in crates/motion/src/machining3d/params.rs, Pocket3DParams::validate. The stepover <= 0 check is unconditional, while the diameter bound already checks !self.strategy.steps_by_load().\nUpstream main db091cb3 still has the defect. No open PR listed the expected files: crates/motion/src/machining3d/params.rs, crates/motion/tests/optimal_load.rs, docs/decisions/1547-hidden-stepover.md.\nNo code changed. No tests or gate ran. No held patch exists. Releasing this claim; the issue is free for a high-tier worker.\n",
